**Summary**
- Added a Clarification stage between Refine and Structure: 6-step wizard now reads Topic → Refine → Clarify → Structure → Approve → Generate.
- New `POST /api/wizard/clarify` route uses the US-053 connector (`selectConnector()`) — Agent SDK first, `claude -p` subprocess fallback, 503 with the same actionable body when neither is available, retries once on parse failure then surfaces 502.
- `parseClarifyResponse()` is forgiving (raw JSON / fenced / brace-scan), auto-fills missing ids, dedupes collisions, caps at 10 entries.
- Stage UI renders questions as labelled textareas, persists answers on the wizard `Draft`, supports Skip-all, and shows a danger-coloured error bubble with Retry on connector failure.
- CourseSpec gained an optional `clarification` field; `buildCourseSpec` only serializes non-empty answers.
- Quality: typecheck clean; vitest 397/397 (26 new in `clarify.test.ts`); browser-verified via playwright (Topic → Refine → Clarify → fill answers → forward → back → assert persistence; plus error/Retry and Skip-all paths). Screenshots at `/tmp/us091-clarify-{loaded,back,error}.png`.
- Two commits in HEAD: `35d258e` (feature) and `d0271a6` (UTF-8 fix for an accidental `\uXXXX` round-trip in prd.json). US-091 `passes: true` confirmed in HEAD.
